<title>UK: Trinkaus sets warrants on German stocks.</title>
<headline>Trinkaus sets warrants on German stocks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinkaus and Burkhard KGaA said it has issued American-style call warrants of five million per tranche on 12 German stocks.</p>
<p>The stocks are BASF AG  , Bayer AG, Daimler-Benz AG, Deutsche Bank AG, Deutsche Lufthansa AG, Deutsche Telekom AG, Hoechst AG, Mannesmann AG, RWE AG, Thyssen AG, VEBA AG and Volkswagen AG.</p>
<p>Maturities range between November 14, 1997 and March 13, 1998. Payment date is April 22, 1997. The warrants are all listed on the Duesseldorf, Frankfurt and Stuttgart exchanges. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
